                "title": "Metro Leverset with Square Rose,",
                "description": "Undeniably alluring in design, this solid brass lever will add a modern accent to any door. The Metro Leverset is available in 5 finishes. The square rose has concealed screw mounting (installation screws are hidden), for a very contemporary look. The Omnia 914S Metro Door Lever with Square Rose is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. \r\n",
